WEBVTT

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:33.600
vyenye hali zisio za kibinaadamu
unazoweza kuwaza.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:38.720
Na tulitishiwa na wafungwa

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:44.120
na maji ya kunywa
yaliyotoka chooni.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:51.080
Hatimae tuliachiwa siku ya sita,

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:57.096
bila ujuzi wowote,
bila onyo lolote.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.896
Ilitokea tu,

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.360
tulitolewa.